abstract: >-
  The Lean 4 development, finite models, result snapshot, checking scripts and
  manuscript sources for a paper on what makes a transfer of organization
  between finite systems a continuation rather than a copy: realization on the
  target, live-overlap lineage, and autonomy after withdrawal.
